{"reviewId": "62629558_863tbMawd", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "那为什么要让人民币升值？人民币升值卖给消费国的商品价格不就高了？", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "13742-13828", "abstract": "就现在的共生模式而言，美国与20世纪70年代相比越来越脱离制造领域，但是美国的消费越来越依赖制造终端。所以，我们的基本判断是，与70年代相比，美国对通货膨胀的抵御力在增强。", "type": 1, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "chapterUid": 9, "chapterName": "04 长波衰退中的增长与通胀", "chapterIdx": 9, "reviewId": "62629558_863tbMawd", "userVid": 62629558, "topics": [], "createTime": 1768047675, "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "04 长波衰退中的增长与通胀", "author": {"userVid": 62629558, "name": "刘晓晴", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/S4eZ1S9NekCAEQnvfrshBibuMRSmeUFPxgkibkt2RibiaRruYEVe3Z5u0icQB7MTCArGwYnsQrKHzBXuvOf863c8zBNgUbpP7xeoiaibpkOdBuh2uE/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20241125-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 0, "likes": [], "commentsCount": 5, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "不是要让人民币升值，它常年赤字就是会贬值，它贬值了人民币不就升值了", "reviewId": "62629558_863tbMawd", "commentId": "62629558_863tbMawd_c434210268_88jrdL7EC", "userVid": 434210268, "createTime": 1775997905, "likesCount": 1, "isLike": 0, "author": {"userVid": 434210268, "name": "y y y", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/nibxxlib1VaPdDcMYRCUfjAC1oarb7O9sn9VnPq2tHKpDUIPZIBevbMLUyFM1cZiauP7ESlZqNPibLI/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M15-1-0", "desc": "21天阅读挑战", "title": "21天阅读挑战", "levelIndex": 0}}}, {"content": "欠钱了有两种选择，要么老实打工还债，要么印钱贬值货币，让自己贬值就是让债务国货币升值。在这个贬值过程中可以把生产过程转移给其他国家，并且重新开始积累新的债务。这是一种赖账行为", "reviewId": "62629558_863tbMawd", "commentId": "62629558_863tbMawd_c82771141_87rhwIADL", "userVid": 82771141, "createTime": 1772921811, "likesCount": 3, "isLike": 0, "author": {"userVid": 82771141, "name": "Eureka", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEL06Gr3H0hfaEu7I0Smicr00tPtULAblgnwpicuXyb08qeauCkKdvjuibZtzFwZhuuU6MqMtkofq6eOIjuLxFGS1Hnz74qNruaeE1kMCUausickPA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": ""}}, {"content": "财政赤字太高，美国要化债，必须让美元走弱，代价是人民币被动走强", "reviewId": "62629558_863tbMawd", "commentId": "62629558_863tbMawd_c47499302_87nySPZ1L", "userVid": 47499302, "createTime": 1772710512, "likesCount": 3, "isLike": 0, "author": {"userVid": 47499302, "name": "L", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/Ib5852jAybicP6njMScZJ2qzmliazzYtSZsKFGeo7ibq5zR1P8ic9EmwSVcicMOma7lVZTXIsMV6mmDA/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-10", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 10}}}, {"content": "所以现在国家政策方针提高内需能力，减缓出口压力对经济的增长速度", "reviewId": "62629558_863tbMawd", "commentId": "62629558_863tbMawd_c344392134_877569Fk2", "userVid": 344392134, "createTime": 1771774420, "author": {"userVid": 344392134, "name": "ZHANGSHIRONG", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/jra7iaS1LaHfdGaYT7nTj8oEDTJCOYRbw5rj5IkUkCyJVnCGHJibLDich9apK77xLNfDKm2R6xb9Ho/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-10", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 10}}}, {"content": "出口顺差太大了，相当于我们把国外的钱都挣过来了，不花出去，容易引起国外系统危机，并且适当升值能够吸引外资来投资国内成长性行业，还能淘汰那些低效高成本的出口企业", "reviewId": "62629558_863tbMawd", "commentId": "62629558_863tbMawd_c345887870_86yV5nCc4", "userVid": 345887870, "createTime": 1769834040, "likesCount": 4, "isLike": 0, "author": {"userVid": 345887870, "name": "jie", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/ibQA60nNv8AJhTu46nhr23ZNsouLpZXnRKr0lBtRiaSYvTgcl7yTdKTJxC7GJlC2PEicib36NUK2RjbvMZibZ0qnOicKDtIeBcMUkt8cUceQnA0FQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-365", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 365}}}], "dislikeCount": 0, "synckey": 1790900820}